THIRD-PARTY MODELS AND DATA

The MIT licence above covers this repository's own code. It does not relicense
the model weights or the datasets, which carry their own terms:

  - MedGemma (google/medgemma-*) — Google Health AI Developer Foundations
    terms of use. Not distributed with this repository; download it yourself
    and accept the terms at that point.

  - CAMUS — the echocardiography segmentation dataset, released for research
    use by the University of Lyon (CREATIS). Cite the dataset paper if you
    publish results derived from the echo checkpoint.

  - PTB-XL — the 12-lead ECG dataset, published on PhysioNet under the Open
    Data Commons Attribution Licence v1.0. Attribution is required.

  - segmentation-models-pytorch, timm, PyTorch and the other dependencies —
    their own licences, unchanged, as resolved by your package manager.
